<worksheet >
    <title>EIPO-6 Least Squares</title>
  <introduction>
    <p>To earn an M on this outcome, give <m>A^TA, A^Ty,(A^TA)^{-1}</m> and the correct solution. 
      To earn a P, give <m>A^TA, A^Ty</m> with progress on <m>(A^TA)^{-1}</m>.</p>
  </introduction>  
   <page>
      <exercise>
  <p>Given the data points <m>(-3,5), (-1,3),</m> and <m>(1,2)</m>. Find the least-squares 
    best fit line for the data points.</p>
</exercise>
  </page>
</worksheet>